<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<!--
  go2_posture_demo.xml — StandUp → SetBodyPose(forward-tilt) →
  hold 2s → SetLedBrightness ramp (0→2→4→6→8→10, 2s each) →
  SwitchGait round-trip (free_walk → classic_walk on → classic_walk
  off → economic → static) → SetBodyPose(recenter pitch) → hold 2s
  → clear_bridge → settle 1.5s → StandDown.

  SetBodyPose is a BT::RosServiceNode thin shell over the standalone
  body_pose_bridge_node (which holds the pose via 50Hz republish — see
  docs/superpowers/specs/2026-10-10-body-pose-bridge-design.md). The
  `clear="true"` instance cancels the bridge's 50Hz hold so StandDown
  can take over the /api/sport/request channel.

  2026-10-13 v7 简化:Go2 固件对 BodyHeight api(1013)bh_off 不响应
  (真机验证 act body_h 在 bh_off=0 vs -0.18 几乎无差),SetBodyPose
  移除 body_height 字段、bridge 3-call (Euler+BH+BalStand) 退化为
  2-call (Euler+BalStand)、50Hz refresh 退化为 Euler-only。本树原
  lower_bodyheight / hold_low_2s / recenter_bodyheight 步骤整段去掉,
  body 升降需求由 StandUp 的身高档位(api 1004)覆盖。SetBodyPose
  现在只做 rpy 倾斜演示。

  2026-10-13 v8 增补 + v9 修订:用户要"完成前倾后打开灯光到10,
  两秒后切换其他步态(灵动/经典/经济)",在 hold_tilt_2s 之后插
  入 SetLedBrightness + SwitchGait 演示块。SwitchGait v9 改为
  Pattern A(fire-and-forget)— Go2 固件接收 v0.2.0+ 新 gait
  命令并目视执行,但不更新 lf/sportmodestate 的 gait_type /
  mode / foot_speed_body 任何字段(deepwiki 引用 unitree_sdk2
  _python 文档"Free gait family is decoupled from the classical
  gait state machine ... expected firmware behavior, not a bug"),
  所以完成判据只能 trust publish;官方 SportClient 也是 publish-
  only 无 state verify,见 feedback_go2_new_gait_state_dead。bridge
  50Hz Euler refresh 在 v8.2 测试中证伪不是根因(clear bridge 后
  SwitchGait 仍然 FAILURE),但 v8.2 的 clear_before_light 步骤仍然
  保留(让 channel 干净)。注意 free_walk / classic_walk / economic /
  static 都是行走类 gait(mode-switch,不主动位移),不会让狗走开,
  但操作者仍应准备好 StandDown 兜底(本树的 ForceSuccess + cleanup
  子树正是为此)。

  2026-10-14 v10:用户要"灯光从0到10变化,每次步进2,停留2秒",
  原 SetLedBrightness level=10 + hold_bright_2s 单步改为 6 步
  ramp:0→2→4→6→8→10,每步 publish VUI 1005 + 2s dwell,
  total 12s。VUI SetBrightness 是 fire-and-forget(与 SwitchGait
  同类 — 见 feedback_go2_new_gait_state_dead),不校验回执,
  操作员目视亮度递增即可。

  Tree ID: Go2PostureDemo (PascalCase, matches PickAndPlaceDemo /
    HeadToArmLookat convention in this package).

  Nodes used:
    - StandUp, StandDown: BT StatefulActionNode, registered in
      bt_plugin_registration.cpp (Tasks 2-3, 2026-10-10).
    - SetBodyPose: BT::RosServiceNode<SetBodyPose>, registered in
      bt_plugin_registration.cpp. Service implementation lives in
      body_pose_bridge package.
    - SwitchGait, SetLedBrightness: BT StatefulActionNode,
      registered in bt_plugin_registration.cpp (2026-10-13). SwitchGait
      publishes to /api/sport/request (api_id 1061/1062/1063/2045 +
      flag 系列 2046-2051/2054),SetLedBrightness publishes to
      rt/api/vui/request (api_id 1005,屏幕亮度 0-10)。
    - Sequence, RetryUntilSuccessful, Sleep: BT.CPP v4 built-in, no
      registration needed.

  Topology:
    Sequence "posture_demo_with_cleanup" (parent)
      ForceSuccess "best_effort_round_trip"
        Sequence "posture_round_trip" (happy path — all SUCCESS to return SUCCESS)
          RetryUntilSuccessful num_attempts=3
            StandUp           (publish 1004, wait body_h >= 0.30 x5)
          SetBodyPose        rpy=[0, +0.30, 0]  → bridge enters HOLDING + 50Hz Euler republish
          Sleep msec=2000    (hold the tilt for 2 s; bridge keeps republishing)
          SetBodyPose        clear=true         → bridge IDLE, cancel 50Hz timer, 释放 /api/sport/request 通道
          Sleep msec=500     (let bridge settle IDLE before gait switch)
          SetLedBrightness   level=0,2,4,6,8,10 → 6 步 ramp,每步 publish VUI 1005,fire-and-forget
          Sleep msec=2000    (×6,每步 dwell 2 s; ramp total 12 s)
          SwitchGait         gait_name=free_walk             → bridge publish 2045 trigger (灵动)
          Sleep msec=2000    (hold free_walk for 2 s)
          SwitchGait         gait_name=classic_walk enable=true → bridge publish 2049 flag (经典)
          Sleep msec=2000    (hold classic_walk enabled for 2 s)
          SwitchGait         gait_name=classic_walk enable=false → bridge publish 2049 flag (退经典)
          SwitchGait         gait_name=economic              → bridge publish 1063 trigger (续航)
          Sleep msec=2000    (hold economic for 2 s)
          SwitchGait         gait_name=static                → bridge publish 1061 trigger (回安全 gait)
          SetBodyPose        rpy=[0, 0, 0]      → bridge live-updates target (pitch recenter)
          Sleep msec=2000    (hold the recentered pose for 2 s)
          SetBodyPose        clear=true         → bridge cancels timer + sends final neutral
          Sleep msec=1500    (let servo settle)
          RetryUntilSuccessful num_attempts=3
            StandDown        (publish 1005, wait body_h < 0.20 x5)
      Sequence "posture_cleanup" (always runs after the wrapper; 2026-10-10
        A fix — guarantees release of /api/sport/request and a physical
        down-state even if the happy path FAILURE'd mid-sequence.)
        SetBodyPose        clear=true         → release bridge HOLDING if any
                                              (idempotent: "clear_already_idle")
        RetryUntilSuccessful num_attempts=3
          StandDown                          → physical fail-safe: dog down

  SetBodyPose semantics: SetBodyPose is a BT::RosServiceNode client
  that delegates to body_pose_bridge_node. The bridge holds the
  Go2's rpy via 50Hz republish of Euler(1007) (v6 drop-BalanceStand-
  from-refresh; v7 2026-10-13 drop-BodyHeight-from-refresh — see
  feedback_go2_bodyheight_1013_unresponsive), with a one-shot
  Euler+BalanceStand pair fired in handle_set_body_pose to latch
  entry into balance mode. The pair is bundled because the Go2
  state machine latches rpy at BalanceStand time (sending Euler
  AFTER BalanceStand is silently dropped — this is the 2026-10-10
  lesson; see `unitree_sdk2/example/go2/go2_sport_client.cpp:63-67`
  case `balance_stand` annotated "controlled by dBodyHeight + rpy"
  — the SDK comment mentions body_h but Go2 firmware does not honor
  it, hence v7 simplification).

  v7 lifecycle (2026-10-13, supersedes v6's 3-call + Euler+BH refresh):
  handle_set_body_pose fires the 2-call (Euler+BalStand) + starts
  the Euler-only refresh timer + returns SUCCESS immediately. BT
  owns lifecycle: successive SetBodyPose calls live-update target
  rpy (no BalanceStand re-entry, no BodyHeight); clear=true cancels
  the refresh timer + sends a final neutral pair.

  Sign conventions (verified on real hardware 2026-10-10):
    - pitch: Go2 firmware INVERTS the standard right-hand rule.
      pitch>0 = nose DOWN, pitch<0 = nose UP. XML uses pitch=+0.30
      (~+17°) for "forward-tilt down". Original spec used +0.5236
      (~30°) but starting from rpy=[0,-0.090,*] that's a 35° pitch
      swing — generous tolerance (±0.05 rad) gave the dog only a
      narrow ~3° window to settle in. Dropped to +0.30 rad (~17°)
      on 2026-10-10 as the BCD fix; raise back toward 0.5236 once
      Go2 firmware stability at extreme pitches is re-verified.
    - (v7 removed) body_height offset: was used for the
      lower/recenter body_h step. Range [-0.18, +0.03] per Go2
      spec, but the firmware is a dead control (no observed
      response to bh_off) so the field was removed from the
      .srv interface and the corresponding demo steps were
      removed from this tree.

  Retry rationale: StandUp/StandDown may fail transiently if the
  machine is mid-motion when the BT tick fires. 3 retries gives a
  cheap robustness bump without hiding real faults. SetBodyPose
  steps are NOT wrapped in retry — a single FAILURE aborts the
  demo so the operator notices.

  Recovery rationale (2026-10-10 A fix): the inner Sequence is
  wrapped in <ForceSuccess> with an always-run cleanup subtree
  after it. Trade-off: BT.CPP v4 has TryCatch but it forces
  FAILURE on the catch path, and RecoveryNode is not built-in
  in v4 (it's only in nav2_behavior_tree). ForceSuccess is
  the simplest way to express "always run the cleanup subtree,
  regardless of whether the happy path failed or succeeded".
  Consequence: if the happy path FAILS but the cleanup subtree
  SUCCEEDS, the action result is SUCCESS (dog is in safe down
  state), and the operator sees no failure. This is intentional
  — for a one-shot posture demo the dog being safely down is
  the only outcome we care about. If the cleanup subtree itself
  fails (dog won't go down), the outer Sequence propagates that
  FAILURE to the action result and the operator sees a real
  fault.

  The bridge-clear step in the cleanup subtree is the one that
  actually addresses the 2026-10-10 incident: without it, a
  mid-tree FAILURE (e.g. SetBodyPose SERVICE_TIMEOUT) would leave
  the bridge HOLDING at the commanded rpy, and StandDown's 1005
  publish would be stomped by the bridge's 50Hz Euler republish
  on every tick until the bridge process dies. With the cleanup,
  we explicitly cancel the bridge BEFORE StandDown, transferring
  ownership of /api/sport/request back to the StandUp/StandDown
  BT nodes.

  Trigger:
    ros2 action send_goal /lgw_bt_execution \
      btcpp_ros2_interfaces/action/ExecuteTree \
      "{target_tree: Go2PostureDemo}"
-->
<root BTCPP_format="4" main_tree_to_execute="Go2PostureDemo">
  <BehaviorTree ID="Go2PostureDemo">
    <Sequence name="posture_demo_with_cleanup">
      <ForceSuccess name="best_effort_round_trip">
        <Sequence name="posture_round_trip">
          <RetryUntilSuccessful num_attempts="3">
            <StandUp name="stand_up"/>
          </RetryUntilSuccessful>
          <SetBodyPose name="tilt_forward_down"
                       roll="0.0" pitch="0.30" yaw="0.0"
                       tolerance_rpy="0.05"/>
          <Sleep name="hold_tilt_2s" msec="2000"/>
          <!-- v8.2 (2026-10-13): 假设测试 — bridge 50Hz Euler 一直
           在 HOLDING,占住 /api/sport/request 通道,SwitchGait 命令
           被 50Hz Euler 刷新踩掉,gait_type 一直 0 → timeout。
           v8.1 试 rpy=0 归位(bridge 还在 50Hz 刷 rpy=0)没用。
           v8.2 改 clear=true:把 bridge 完全 IDLE,50Hz timer cancel,
           只发最后一次 Euler(0,0,0)+BalStand 收尾,通道释放后
           再做 SwitchGait。recenter_pose 步骤在 gait demo 之后还
           在(把狗拉回中立再走 clear_bridge→StandDown 流程)。 -->
          <SetBodyPose name="clear_before_light" clear="true"/>
          <Sleep name="hold_clear_before_light" msec="500"/>
          <SetLedBrightness name="brighten_to_0"
                            level="0"/>
          <Sleep name="hold_step_0" msec="2000"/>
          <SetLedBrightness name="brighten_to_2"
                            level="2"/>
          <Sleep name="hold_step_1" msec="2000"/>
          <SetLedBrightness name="brighten_to_4"
                            level="4"/>
          <Sleep name="hold_step_2" msec="2000"/>
          <SetLedBrightness name="brighten_to_6"
                            level="6"/>
          <Sleep name="hold_step_3" msec="2000"/>
          <SetLedBrightness name="brighten_to_8"
                            level="8"/>
          <Sleep name="hold_step_4" msec="2000"/>
          <SetLedBrightness name="brighten_to_10"
                            level="10"/>
          <Sleep name="hold_step_5" msec="2000"/>
          <SwitchGait name="enter_free_walk"
                      gait_name="free_walk"/>
          <Sleep name="hold_free_walk_2s" msec="2000"/>
          <SwitchGait name="enter_classic_walk"
                      gait_name="classic_walk" enable="true"/>
          <Sleep name="hold_classic_walk_2s" msec="2000"/>
          <SwitchGait name="exit_classic_walk"
                      gait_name="classic_walk" enable="false"/>
          <SwitchGait name="enter_economic"
                      gait_name="economic"/>
          <Sleep name="hold_economic_2s" msec="2000"/>
          <SwitchGait name="back_to_static"
                      gait_name="static"/>
          <SetBodyPose name="recenter_pose"
                       roll="0.0" pitch="0.0" yaw="0.0"
                       tolerance_rpy="0.05"/>
          <Sleep name="hold_recenter_2s" msec="2000"/>
          <SetBodyPose name="clear_bridge" clear="true"/>
          <Sleep name="settle_after_recenter" msec="1500"/>
          <RetryUntilSuccessful num_attempts="3">
            <StandDown name="stand_down"/>
          </RetryUntilSuccessful>
        </Sequence>
      </ForceSuccess>
      <Sequence name="posture_cleanup">
        <SetBodyPose name="clear_bridge_always" clear="true"/>
        <RetryUntilSuccessful num_attempts="3">
          <StandDown name="stand_down_always"/>
        </RetryUntilSuccessful>
      </Sequence>
    </Sequence>
  </BehaviorTree>
</root>
